sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant App as App (UI)
    participant B as Bank
    participant S as Account (sender)
    participant D as Account (receiver)
    participant R as Repository
    participant F as FraudDetector
    participant L as AuditLogger
    C->>App: choose payee, amount, category
    App->>C: confirmation card (Y/N)
    C->>App: yes
    App->>B: transfer(from, to, amount, category)
    B->>B: validate accounts, not same, receiver active
    B->>S: withdraw(amount, fee)
    alt insufficient funds
        S-->>B: InsufficientFundsException
        B->>B: failedOps + 1
        B-->>App: error
        App-->>C: red error banner
    else enough balance
        S-->>B: balance reduced
        B->>D: deposit(amount)
        B->>R: append TransferOut and TransferIn
        B->>R: patch both balances in place (seekp)
        B->>F: evaluate(tx, context)
        F-->>B: matching rules
        opt any rule fires
            B->>R: save Alert
            B->>L: FRAUD_ALERT
        end
        B-->>App: Transaction
        App-->>C: receipt card and saved receipt file
    end
